  aciklama:
  - "Sayg\u0131de\u011Fer {{soyisim}}, fincan\u0131n\u0131n bahsini hen\xFCz a\xE7mad\u0131\u011F\u0131m
    son b\xF6l\xFCmlerinde, seni dibe do\u011Fru \xE7eken bir \"h\xFCz\xFCn girdab\u0131\"
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Sen, fark\u0131ndal\u0131\u011F\u0131 son derece y\xFCksek birisin.
    Sevin\xE7leri de h\xFCz\xFCnleri de \xE7ok detayl\u0131 alg\u0131l\u0131yor,
    di\u011Fer insanlara g\xF6re \"daha y\xFCksek \xE7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCkte\" duyumsuyorsun.
    Bu durum seni \xE7ok y\u0131pratm\u0131\u015F. Fal\u0131n, \xF6zel hayat\u0131nda
    kati surette mutlu olaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131n bilgisini veriyor. Kendi i\xE7 m\xFCcadeleni
    en aza indirgemeli ve hayat\u0131n sana sunaca\u011F\u0131 yeni g\xFCzellikleri
    ka\xE7\u0131rmamal\u0131s\u0131n. A\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda g\xF6nl\xFCn kadar
    g\xFCzel g\xFCnler ya\u015Fayacaks\u0131n..."
